<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000 tonnes soybeans.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA to tender for 54,000 tonnes soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taichung division of Taiwan's Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association will tender on Friday for a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The Breakfast association's Taichung division comprises Chia Hsin, Formosa Oilseed, Fwu Sow Grain, and Tay Shan.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>  Tonnes   Date/Location</p>
<p>	     U.S. Gulf    Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>  54,000   Sep 16-30    Oct 1-15</p>
<p>-- George Hsu, Taipei newsroom (886-2-5080815)</p>
</text>
